   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1.  Our param reaches litellm \u2014 LiteLlm.__init__ stores unknown kwargs in _additional_args, and\n     completion_args.update(self._additional_args)  (google/adk/models/lite_llm.py:3182).\n2.  ADK defers to it \u2014 its own builder applies only  if cache_config is not None and\n     \"cache_control_injection_points\" not in completion_args.\n3.  The type accepts it \u2014  ttl: NotRequired[Literal[\"5m\", \"1h\"]].",
   "originalText": "1.  Our param reaches litellm \u2014 LiteLlm.__init__ stores unknown kwargs in _additional_args, and\n     completion_args.update(self._additional_args)  (google/adk/models/lite_llm.py:3182).\n2.  ADK defers to it \u2014 its own builder applies only  if cache_config is not None and\n     \"cache_control_injection_points\" not in completion_args.\n3.  The type accepts it \u2014  ttl: NotRequired[Literal[\"5m\", \"1h\"]].",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true,
   "baseline": 14
  },
  {
